OL,3,AAnthropic bans users from being 'cruel'
OL,4,Ato its AI systems
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic has raised eyebrows by
OL,7,Fannouncing it will ban users from
OL,8,F"sustained and needless" abusive
OL,9,Fbehaviour towards its AI.
OL,11,FThe Claude-maker said on Thursday it
OL,12,Fwas updating its usage policy to let
OL,13,Fits tools end interactions where people
OL,14,Fare "cruel" - something it said it had
OL,15,Fdone in "rare" cases prior.
OL,17,FIt will now be included on a list of
OL,18,Fforbidden conduct which also contains
OL,19,Fbullying others, promoting self-harm
OL,20,Fand creating non-consensual intimate
OL,21,Fimagery.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
