OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AFired OpenAI researchers say they were
OL,4,Alet go for 'prioritising safety'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 2 October, a spokesperson for the AI
OL,7,Ffirm told the BBC its investigation
OL,8,F"confirmed that these individuals
OL,9,Fmishandled sensitive information
OL,10,Foutside established company
OL,11,Fprocedures".
OL,13,FOpenAI repeated these claims on Friday
OL,14,Fmorning in a note from research
OL,15,Fleaders.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
