OL,3,AUS country music star Ella Langley
OL,4,Acancels show due to 'security threat'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS country music star Ella Langley has
OL,7,Fsaid she had to cancel her sold-out
OL,8,Fconcert in Tulsa, Oklahoma on Friday
OL,9,Fnight, due to a "serious security
OL,10,Fthreat".
OL,12,FThe singer made what she called the
OL,13,F"incredibly difficult" decision around
OL,14,Ftwo hours before the show at the
OL,15,F19,000-seater arena was due to start.
OL,17,FIn a post on Instagram, the 27-year-old
OL,18,Fsaid the threat involved "the safety of
OL,19,Fmy fans, the venue staff and my team".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
